    lazyPanelsTitle: "Panels on demand",
    lazyPanelsHint: "Creates popups (music, power, settings, network, bluetooth, notifications, walls, dashboard…) and their windows only when opened and destroys them on close: less VRAM, RAM and idle work. The first open takes a fraction of a second longer. The launcher, clipboard, dock and wallpapers stay loaded so they open instantly.",
